No, hang in there!

75
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,440
That's enough!

76
00:04:38,780 --> 00:04:42,380
A little too late to reconsider my offer.

77
00:04:42,740 --> 00:04:47,577
I gave you several chances to escape,
but you two thought you knew better?

78
00:04:47,660 --> 00:04:49,366
and chose this fate yourself.

79
