But just to make it abundantly
clear, Your fun-ins now.

115
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:35,020
This is your final resting place!

116
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:44,940
Candy Maiden!

117
00:07:45,580 --> 00:07:46,860
What is candy?

118
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:49,280
