119
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,544
Lickety-look at what it can do!

120
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:58,640
Fishman Karate!

121
00:08:01,460 --> 00:08:02,290
Ah!

122
00:08:03,260 --> 00:08:04,090
Ah!

123
00:08:04,173 --> 00:08:05,003
Ah!

124
