receiving end of her hunger pegs.

154
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,500
Good lickety-luck.

155
00:11:08,580 --> 00:11:10,800
Harm-a-ment harnet!

156
00:11:13,940 --> 00:11:15,780
Kong Kong!

157
00:11:17,620 --> 00:11:19,040
Kong Kong!

158
00:11:22,780 --> 00:11:23,700
Kong!

159
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:34,480
What the hell?

160
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:36,460
Why isn't my Haki working?

161
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:49,990
Chopper!

162
00:11:50,073 --> 00:11:51,200
Brook, are you okay?

163
00:11:51,580 --> 00:11:52,760
Don't give up yet!

164
00:11:56,660 --> 00:11:59,040
Where's my cake?

165
00:12:05,940 --> 00:12:07,120
Hey, Carrot.

166
00:12:08,540 --> 00:12:11,520
Be prepared for a sudden
turn of events. What?

167
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:13,720
Listen closely.

168
00:12:14,980 --> 00:12:18,317
I firmly believe Luffy and
his crew are those whom our

169
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:21,518
tribe and the Kozuki clan
have awaited for centuries.

170
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:26,289
The ones who will lead all of
us to the dawn of a new world!

171
00:12:26,660 --> 00:12:28,060
Well, I see this now!

172
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:41,560
Are you there, Mondor?

173
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:42,801
Can you hear me?

174
00:12:43,460 --> 00:12:45,000
Yeah, loud and clear.

175
00:12:45,660 --> 00:12:49,677
We will lead you to arrange a ship
blockade around the southwest coast.

176
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:50,590
Immediately.

177
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,580
You got it, Press.

178
00:12:53,680 --> 00:12:54,510
Click.

179
00:12:54,940 --> 00:12:57,411
It said that we are to surround the coast.

180
00:13:00,100 --> 00:13:01,040
Coup de what?

181
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,000
Please explain.

182
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,840
We'll use Coup de Burst.

183
00:13:05,020 --> 00:13:07,549
This ship can leap a
whole kilometer ahead.

184
00:13:07,780 --> 00:13:10,960
If we don't use it, Big Mom
is just going to sink us.

185
