If you think it'll be enough to
escape her grasp, then I won't argue.

186
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:19,040
Okay, let's bet our getaway on that.

187
00:13:20,580 --> 00:13:22,780
Hey, guys, I think Mom's here.

188
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:24,460
Thought you could run?

189
00:13:26,260 --> 00:13:29,280
Hey, Carrot, go help Luffy set sail.

190
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:30,940
Hurry up!

191
