Ma-ma-ma-ma!

192
00:13:37,540 --> 00:13:40,100
I know it must be here someplace.

193
00:13:40,860 --> 00:13:42,520
Now, where could it be?

194
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:53,480
Hey, Brooke, Chopper,
stay strong, my friends.

195
00:13:53,900 --> 00:13:57,500
It'd be a bitter escape if you
two didn't make it with us.

196
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:03,699
We've located the Straw
Hats at the Southwest Coast.

197
00:14:04,700 --> 00:14:07,700
Minister Amand from the
Nuts Island Tartt speaking.

198
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,706
We're approaching the target.

199
00:14:18,380 --> 00:14:21,177
Those battleships are closing
in on us from the sea.

200
00:14:21,260 --> 00:14:23,957
And Big Mom looms over us on land.

201
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:26,500
I'm afraid we're trapped in the middle.

202
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:35,717
Mommy, we have to get going!

203
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:37,457
I'm trying to.

204
00:14:37,540 --> 00:14:40,777
I still have to load up two more
big barrels of cola, though.

205
00:14:40,860 --> 00:14:42,157
Then let me handle this.

206
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:44,837
Go help prepare the coop,
do whatever it is, okay?

207
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:46,360
Thanks. I'm on it.

208
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:06,680
Let me wave!

209
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:20,977
What's that candy?

210
00:15:21,060 --> 00:15:25,080
Just our luck we can't use
coo to burst like this!

211
00:15:34,180 --> 00:15:35,117
Something up?

212
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,617
We hit a snag.

213
00:15:36,700 --> 00:15:39,641
The Sunny is trapped in
some kind of sticky candy.

214
00:15:43,700 --> 00:15:47,157
Take a good lickety look
at my candy. Wave's power.

215
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:49,937
I'll admire its perfection with you.

216
00:15:50,020 --> 00:15:51,840
It's the tomb guy!

217
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:55,980
What should we do?

218
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:58,946
You turn my friend in
the ship back right now!

219
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:00,040
Candy creep!

220
00:16:02,340 --> 00:16:03,860
This is getting dire.

221
00:16:06,300 --> 00:16:07,357
Kaku!

222
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:10,220
Will mama lickity kick
your butts to the curb?

223
00:16:10,620 --> 00:16:13,740
Will the cannons capsize you before then?

224
00:16:26,340 --> 00:16:28,120
Look at you vermin!

225
00:16:28,700 --> 00:16:29,530
Pathetic!

226
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:31,600
All your hope is lost!

227
00:17:04,120 --> 00:17:05,800
Beast sword!

228
00:17:06,340 --> 00:17:07,380
Karajishi!

229
00:17:18,500 --> 00:17:21,780
You do realize my bounty is 700 million.

230
00:17:22,260 --> 00:17:24,060
And what are you worth?

231
00:17:25,360 --> 00:17:29,360
Surely you knew that you were way
out of your lickety-league, kitty.

232
00:17:29,620 --> 00:17:30,720
How pitiful.

233
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:43,120
You avoided death by
the skin of your tongue.

234
00:17:46,220 --> 00:17:47,957
I can't die just yet.

235
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:49,917
The dawn of the new world is coming soon.

236
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:52,040
I can't rest until I've seen it!

237
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:56,200
Ma-ma-ma-ma.

238
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:58,077
Well, aren't you a char?

239
00:17:58,160 --> 00:18:00,277
I'll make it fifty years, then.

240
00:18:00,360 --> 00:18:02,520
Enjoy the rest of your life!

241
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:05,160
I must hand it to you.

242
00:18:05,420 --> 00:18:07,980
It was clever to sacrifice your left eye.

243
00:18:08,280 --> 00:18:11,221
