for much less, you know.

244
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:14,660
But why do you want to live so badly?

245
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:19,100
Clamming up, huh? Well, fine.

246
00:18:19,420 --> 00:18:20,600
So how old are you?

247
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:22,360
